ind":"announcement","title":"New demo release","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/42433362/f25d36777971d47193dcfe35c547ed2221a5bf0d.png New final demo out now","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-01-27T19:00:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1789580505444215","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2008670-6341720536518465067","game_id":"steam-2008670","kind":"update","title":"RalphGame Halls Demo update","summary":"Hi everyone! I've just released a new build of the demo which now includes a much more informative tutorial, as well as the most up-to-date version of ralph and his mechanics. The level plays the same, but it should be a much cleaner version compared to the previous demo. If you've beat it once, you've already beat it, but if you haven't gotten a chance to, this is the premiere way to test out RalphGame","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-09-23T21:16:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/6341720536518465067","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2008670-5589599109267494577","game_id":"steam-2008670","kind":"announcement","title":"Still here!","summary":"Just realized this steam page hasn't seen an update in quite some time. Here's one! The game is still being developed and as of writing this, Chapter 4 is a few days away from being totally feature complete, with Chapter 5 being scripted now as well. Thank you for supporting and this game WILL come out :D","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-02-09T04:11:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5589599109267494577","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:49Z","discov